"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang code sa pahinang ito ay ginawa gamit ang mga sumusunod na requirements.\n"
"Inirerekomenda naming gamitin ang mga bersyong ito o mas bago.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"This example contains two parts. You will first create a simple \"Hello world\" quantum program and run it on a quantum processing unit (QPU).  Because actual quantum research requires much more robust programs, in the second section ([Scale to large numbers of qubits](#scale-to-large-numbers-of-qubits)), you will scale the simple program up to utility level.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Ang halimbawang ito ay may dalawang bahagi. Una, gagawa ka ng simpleng \"Hello world\" na quantum program at patakbuhin ito sa isang quantum processing unit (QPU). Dahil ang tunay na quantum research ay nangangailangan ng mas matibay na mga programa, sa ikalawang bahagi ([I-scale sa malaking bilang ng qubits](#scale-to-large-numbers-of-qubits)), iscale mo ang simpleng programa hanggang sa utility level.\n"

